# Assistant instruction files are configuration, not documentation. The blanket
# *.md rule above would otherwise keep them on a single machine, so every agent
# except the one that wrote them would miss the quality gate contract.
!AGENTS.md
!.github/copilot-instructions.md
!.kiro/steering/*.md
!.kiro/agents/*.md
!.agent/agents/*.md
.vscode
